of the equipment. S/E San Fernando's 52C1 switch was previously in open state due to failure in medium voltage networks (three mountains feeder). d.2 Physical Phenomenon: OPE26: Failure in protection or control system d.3 Reiteration: Reiteration Physical Phenomenon in the affected installation: This installation has not been affected by the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile months. Reiteration Physical Phenomenon in facilities of the same owner: Failures have occurred in installations of the same owner with the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile months: FALLA OPAO_FALLA DATE_FALLA A","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 300/2024\n\u201cFalla en el cierre del interruptor 52C1 de S/E San Fernando\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 29-07-2024\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 06/07/2024\nHora 18:42\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 6.00\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 9913.90\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.061 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n Pa\u00f1o C1 de S/E San Fernando / PA025T0058SE054T0058\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n Subestaci\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 15 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n Zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nAv. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561 Piso 17, Las Condes, Regi\u00f3n Metropolitana de\nDirecci\u00f3n\nSantiago\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento afectado Telecontrol del interruptor 15 kV del pa\u00f1o C1 de S/E San Fernando /\nPA025T0058SE054T0058 (*)\nPropietario elemento fallado CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nAv. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561 Piso 17, Las Condes, Regi\u00f3n Metropolitana de\nDirecci\u00f3n\nSantiago\n(*) El c\u00f3digo corresponde Nemot\u00e9cnico del pa\u00f1o C1 de S/E San Fernando\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo una falla en el cierre del interruptor 52C1 de S/E San Fernando durante las maniobras de\ncierre del interruptor, debido a falla en el sistema de comunicaciones que impide el cierre remoto del\nequipo. El interruptor 52C1 de S/E San Fernando se encontraba previamente en estado abierto debido\na falla en redes de media tensi\u00f3n (alimentador Tres Montes).\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nOPE26: Falla en sistema de protecci\u00f3n o control\nd.3 Reiteraci\u00f3n:\nReiteraci\u00f3n Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico en la instalaci\u00f3n afectada: Esta instalaci\u00f3n no h","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":0.05},{"w":"analysis","s":-0.04},{"w":"eaf","s":-0.04},{"w":"2024","s":0.08},{"w":"switch","s":0.7},{"w":"san","s":0.34},{"w":"date","s":0.07},{"w":"date","s":0.07},{"w":"time","s":0.02},{"w":"date","s":0.07},{"w":"06","s":0.1},{"w":"07","s":-0.15},{"w":"2024","s":0.08},{"w":"time","s":0.02},{"w":"18","s":-0.17},{"w":"mw","s":0.03},{"w":"00","s":0.02},{"w":"prior","s":0.06},{"w":"mw","s":0.03},{"w":"percentage","s":0.09},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.17}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"OPEN CIRCUIT","probs":{"line_fault":0.0232,"breaker_fault":0.7929,"transformer_fault":0.1249,"busbar_fault":0.059},"confidence":0.7929,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"OPEN CIRCUIT","probs":{"line_fault":0.3325,"breaker_fault":0.355,"transformer_fault":0.1865,"busbar_fault":0.126},"confidence":0.355,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"OPEN CIRCUIT","probs":{"line_fault":0.054,"breaker_fault":0.5936,"transformer_fault":0.2043,"busbar_fault":0.1481},"confidence":0.5936,"correct":true}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Within-Modality)","contrib":{"D":{"share":0.0784,"signed":-0.0505},"T":{"share":0.1956,"sign